      "raw": "## Recent Notes\n",
      "level": 2,
      "title": "Recent Notes"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000016",
      "kind": "list",
      "start_line": 29,
      "end_line": 38,
      "raw": "- `DetailPanel.qml` is now only the route-aware router for the detail column, and it switches between\n  `CalendarDetailPanel.qml`, `NoteDetailPanel.qml`, and `ResourceDetailPanel.qml` instead of forcing one note-only\n  form onto every hierarchy or calendar route.\n- `CalendarDetailPanel.qml` is intentionally blank for now, but it already owns a dedicated calendar-detail surface so\n  future calendar-only UI can grow without reopening note/resource branching.\n- `ResourceDetailPanel.qml` is intentionally blank for now, but it already owns a dedicated resource-detail\n  controller contract so future resource-only UI can grow without reopening note-detail branching.\n  surfaces must remain LVRS scale-aware instead of assuming desktop `1.0x` metrics.\n  same hierarchy rendering contract through an overridden `LV.ContextMenu`, and the picker body now renders the full\n  hierarchy as a permanently expanded `LV.HierarchyItem` list instead of an embeddable tree panel.\n",
      "items": [
        {
          "marker": "-",
          "text": "`DetailPanel.qml` is now only the route-aware router for the detail column, and it switches between",
          "checked": null
        },
        {
          "marker": "-",
          "text": "`CalendarDetailPanel.qml` is intentionally blank for now, but it already owns a dedicated calendar-detail surface so",
          "checked": null
        },
        {
          "marker": "-",
          "text": "`ResourceDetailPanel.qml` is intentionally blank for now, but it already owns a dedicated resource-detail",
          "checked": null
        }
      ]
    },
